OL,3,GNEWSAPipeline's route revised after
OL,4,Aplan sparked anger
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe route has been revised of a
OL,7,Fproposed gas pipeline that would see
OL,8,Fcompressed carbon dioxide stored under
OL,9,Fthe sea in a project dubbed dangerous
OL,10,Fand potentially devastating to the
OL,11,Fcountryside.
OL,13,FPeak Cluster, a joint initiative
OL,14,Fbetween four cement firms, said the
OL,15,Fchanges followed consultation and
OL,16,Ftechnical assessments.
OL,18,FTwo arms would begin near Hope,
OL,19,FDerbyshire and Cauldon, Staffordshire,
OL,20,Fjoining together near Marton in
OL,21,FCheshire before heading to Hoylake on
OL,22,Fthe Wirral.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
