OL,3,GNEWSAPipeline's route revised after
OL,4,Aplan sparked anger
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe #5bn government-backed scheme
OL,7,Ffeatures a buried pipeline as well as
OL,8,Fabove-ground installations, but people
OL,9,Fliving along its route are unhappy, and
OL,10,Fone councillor has described it as a
OL,11,F"dangerous, dangerous thing".
